('P-143', 'en', 'Crocodile', '[On Play] If there is a Character with a cost of 0, this Character gains [Rush] during this turn.
(This card can attack on the turn in which it is played.)', '', 2, 'source'),
('P-144', 'en', 'Ms. All Sunday', '[On Play] You may K.O. 1 of your Characters with a type including "Baroque Works": Draw 1 card.', '', 2, 'source'),
